<!--
  A stipulation, not a filing. See assets/fixtures/README.md. Nothing here was observed, and
  nothing here may be cited as evidence about any business.

  The two states `assets/corpus/` does not reach, and they are not cosmetic: they owe
  different arithmetic. The corpus's fusions with no elimination are all one-part fusions
  filing `notApplicable`, so neither of these branches is exercised there.

    baking   eliminations absent none        somebody looked, and the parts count nothing
                                             twice. The composed figure has to equal the
                                             sum exactly, and it does: the two ovens'
                                             demands, 1800 and 900, 2000 and 1000, 2400
                                             and 1200, add up to the 2700, 3000 and 3600
                                             filed, and their nameplates, 2160 and 1080,
                                             to the 3240 filed.

    mixing   eliminations absent unmeasured  nobody checked. No equality is owed, and this
                                             layer files a demand that differs from its
                                             parts on purpose: the parts add up to 2300,
                                             2600 and 3100, and the filed demand is 2000,
                                             2200 and 2700, short by 300, 400 and 400.

  Read the second one twice, because it is the point. A checker that read a search nobody
  made as "nothing to remove" would report a violation here and be wrong: the composer never
  claimed these reconcile, and says so in the document. A checker that read it as "somebody
  checked and found nothing" would hold it to `baking`'s standard and be wrong the same way.
  The honest verdict is unchecked, a third outcome beside passed and failed, and
  `Fusion/eliminations` is the wrapper that lets a document file the state behind it.

  The shortfall is not arbitrary either. It has the shape of a real intra-group commission:
  the mixers take work from each other, and somebody's estimate already nets some of it out,
  by an amount nobody has reconstructed. `unmeasured` is exactly that, filed.
-->
